        files:
        - id: guest-start-here
          name: Start Here.txt
          fileType: 1
          size: 447
          modifiedDate: 2026-10-12
          hidden: 0
          readOnly: 0
          starred: 1
          textContent: 'WORKSPACE GUIDE


            Documents contains the current
            working files.

            Documents/Archive contains previous versions
            and completed work.

            Downloads contains incoming files that
            have not yet been filed.


            Read Handoff Notes for the status
            of ongoing work.

            Read Maintenance Log for recent changes
            to this laptop.


            Before replacing a document, compare its
            revision date with the

            archived copy. Some older versions
            contain comments that were

            not carried forward.'
          previewImage: {fileID: 0}
          contentId: guest-start-here-content
          progressionEventId: 
        - id: guest-priority-tasks
          name: Priority Tasks.txt
          fileType: 1
          size: 525
          modifiedDate: 2026-10-12
          hidden: 0
          readOnly: 0
          starred: 0
          textContent: 'Review the handoff notes.

            Check the maintenance
            log.

            Clean up Downloads.

            Keep the old backups
            until the current documents have been checked.'
          previewImage: {fileID: 0}
          contentId: guest-priority-tasks-content
          progressionEventId: 
        - id: handoff-checklist
          name: Handoff Checklist.txt
          fileType: 1
          size: 536
          modifiedDate: 2026-10-09
          hidden: 0
          readOnly: 0
          starred: 0
          textContent: 'WORKSTATION HANDOFF CHECKLIST


            Use this checklist
            when preparing the laptop for reassignment.


            [ ] Confirm
            current working documents are saved in Documents.

            [ ] Record
            the status of unfinished work in Handoff Notes.

            [ ] Check
            that referenced attachments are included.

            [ ] Record unresolved
            device issues in Maintenance Log.

            [ ] Review Downloads for
            files that still need to be retained.

            [ ] Confirm archived
            copies are readable before removing duplicates.


            Record
            the handoff date and reviewer in Handoff Notes when complete.'
          previewImage: {fileID: 0}
          contentId: guest-handoff-checklist-content
          progressionEventId: 
        - id: guest-review-schedule
          name: Review Schedule.txt
          fileType: 1
          size: 422
          modifiedDate: 2026-10-12
          hidden: 0
          readOnly: 0
          starred: 0
          textContent: "DOCUMENT REVIEW SCHEDULE\nWeek beginning: 12 October 2026\n\nMonday\u2013Tuesday\nReview
            the handoff notes and identify the current versions of\nactive documents.\n\nWednesday\u2013Thursday\nCompare
            archived copies where revisions are unclear. Record\ndiscrepancies in
            the handoff notes.\n\nFriday\nSummarize unresolved items and prepare
            the verified document\nset for review.\n\nArchive cleanup will be scheduled
            after the review is complete."
          previewImage: {fileID: 0}
          contentId: guest-review-schedule-content
          progressionEventId: 
        - id: guest-archive-reference
          name: Archive Reference.txt
          fileType: 1
          size: 514
          modifiedDate: 2026-09-18
          hidden: 0
          readOnly: 0
          starred: 0
          textContent: 'ARCHIVE REFERENCE


            Documents/Archive holds earlier
            document versions and copies

            retained during previous handoffs.


            An
            older modification date does not necessarily mean a file

            has
            been superseded. Check its contents against the current

            working
            version before treating it as a duplicate.


            Retain copies
            containing unique comments, attachments, or

            revision history
            until that information has been accounted for.


            If the relationship
            between two versions is unclear, record

            both filenames in
            Handoff Notes for review.'
          previewImage: {fileID: 0}
          contentId: guest-archive-reference-content
          progressionEventId: 
