          files:
          - id: guest-document-filing-guide
            name: Document Filing Guide.txt
            fileType: 1
            size: 496
            modifiedDate: 2026-09-25
            hidden: 0
            readOnly: 0
            starred: 0
            textContent: 'DOCUMENT FILING GUIDE


              Documents

              Current
              working files and review material.


              Documents/Archive

              Previous
              versions retained for comparison and reference.


              Documents/Work
              Reference

              Procedures, contact information, and equipment
              documentation.


              Downloads

              Incoming files
              awaiting review and filing.


              Keep the original filename
              when first filing an incoming

              document. If two files
              share a name, compare their contents

              before replacing
              either copy.


              Record unresolved version conflicts in
              Handoff Notes.'
            previewImage: {fileID: 0}
            contentId: guest-document-filing-guide-content
            progressionEventId: 
          - id: guest-reference-index
            name: Reference Index.txt
            fileType: 0
            size: 493
            modifiedDate: 2026-10-07
            hidden: 0
            readOnly: 0
            starred: 0
            textContent: 'WORK REFERENCE INDEX


              Document Filing Guide.txt

              Folder
              purposes and guidance for handling duplicate filenames.


              Support
              Contacts.txt

              Which team handles equipment, access, and
              purchasing queries.


              Equipment Service Notes.txt

              Reported
              equipment faults and information for the service visit.


              Equipment
              Warranty.pdf

              Coverage summary and service requirements
              for the issued laptop.


              Current priorities and the review
              schedule are on the desktop.

              Handoff Notes and Maintenance
              Log are in Documents.'
            previewImage: {fileID: 0}
            contentId: guest-reference-index-content
            progressionEventId: 
          - id: guest-support-contacts
            name: Support Contacts.txt
            fileType: 1
            size: 462
            modifiedDate: 2026-08-14
            hidden: 0
            readOnly: 0
            starred: 0
            textContent: 'INTERNAL SUPPORT CONTACTS


              IT Service Desk

              Laptop
              faults, account access, backup, and restore requests.

              Use
              the service portal listed in the company directory.


              Facilities

              Office
              furniture and shared workspace repairs.

              Submit a facilities
              request with the location and asset label.


              Procurement

              Supplier
              invoices, purchase records, and warranty documentation.

              Include
              the purchase reference when available.


              Use the company
              directory for current contact details.'
            previewImage: {fileID: 0}
            contentId: guest-support-contacts-content
            progressionEventId: 
          - id: guest-equipment-service-notes
            name: Equipment Service Notes.txt
            fileType: 1
            size: 502
            modifiedDate: 2026-10-06
            hidden: 0
            readOnly: 0
            starred: 0
            textContent: 'EQUIPMENT SERVICE NOTES

              Recorded: 6 October
              2026


              Reported issues:

              - Storage cabinet
              hinge is loose.

              - Lower drawer sticks when closing.


              Service
              visit:

              Thursday, 8 October, afternoon.


              Requested
              checks:

              Inspect the hinge and drawer runners.

              Confirm
              whether replacement parts are covered by the service agreement.

              Provide
              a written record of the work completed.


              Completion
              status:

              No service report was attached when these notes
              were prepared.

              Check incoming files before marking the
              request complete.'
            previewImage: {fileID: 0}
            contentId: guest-equipment-service-notes-content
            progressionEventId: 
          - id: guest-equipment-warranty
            name: Equipment Warranty.pdf
            fileType: 3
            size: 245760
            modifiedDate: 2026-07-19
            hidden: 0
            readOnly: 0
            starred: 0
            textContent: 'NORTHBRIDGE OFFICE SUPPLY

              EQUIPMENT WARRANTY
              SUMMARY


              Asset reference: OPS-LT-014

              Purchase
              reference: NBS-2026-0719


              Coverage period:

              19
              July 2026 to 18 July 2027


              Covered:

              Manufacturing
              defects in the supplied laptop.

              Replacement parts and
              labor for approved warranty repairs.


              Excluded:

              Accidental
              damage, liquid damage, and unauthorized repairs.

              Consumable
              accessories and normal cosmetic wear.


              Service procedure:

              Contact
              the IT Service Desk with the asset reference and

              a description
              of the fault. Procurement will provide proof

              of purchase
              if the supplier requires it.


              Back up working documents
              before submitting the laptop

              for service.'
            previewImage: {fileID: 0}
            contentId: guest-equipment-warranty-content
            progressionEventId: 
